.TH WC 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wc \- compte lignes, mots, octets / count lines, words, bytes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wc
[-clLmw] [file...]
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints newline, word and byte counts for each file and a total when there are several. Reads standard input when no file is given. Part of the textutil program
(wc, head, tail, cut, paste).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -l
Lines.
.TP
.B -w
Words.
.TP
.B -c
Bytes.
.TP
.B -m
Characters.
.TP
.B -L
Length of the longest line.
.SH SEE ALSO
head(1), tail(1)
